flowchart LR
  Sources["Identity, edge, API, application, data, cloud, endpoint, CI/CD and privacy sources"]
  Collect["Authenticated collectors with schema validation, redaction and durable buffering"]
  Lake["Separately administered security lake and immutable audit evidence"]
  Detect["Detection-as-code, correlation, behavior and threat intelligence"]
  Case["SOC triage and incident or linked fraud case"]
  Respond["Governed human playbook or bounded reversible automation"]
  Forensics["Hash-verified evidence and chain of custody"]
  Recover["Eradication, clean recovery and fiscal reconciliation"]
  Improve["Lessons, control, policy, detection and test update"]
  Assurance["Read-only compliance evidence and independent assurance"]

  Sources --> Collect
  Collect --> Lake
  Lake --> Detect
  Detect --> Case
  Case --> Respond
  Case --> Forensics
  Respond --> Recover
  Forensics --> Recover
  Recover --> Improve
  Improve --> Detect
  Lake --> Assurance
  Case --> Assurance
  Recover --> Assurance
